@startsalt pickup-payment
{+
    <b>CAR RENTAL | Agency employee
    --
    <b>Pick up car - Payment
    RES-001 - Alex Martin - AB-123-CD
    .
    {^"Reservation payment"
        Payment option | Pay at pickup
        Total price | EUR 120.00
        Amount already paid | EUR 0.00
        <b>Amount to collect | <b>EUR 120.00
    }
    .
    {^"Record payment received"
        Collect payment before recording it in the system.
        Payment reference | "PAY-001                      "
        [X] Payment of EUR 120.00 received
        [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-handover Record payment and continue]] ]
    }
    .
    If payment fails, remain here and retry before handing over keys.
    For a prepaid reservation with no balance due, skip this screen.
    --
    [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-inspection Back]] ]
}
@endsalt
